# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: Catalogue BD Category Popup (non paid) (test case 2238, run 115613, last result FAILURE)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

open https://www.justdial.com/Mumbai/Global-View-Borivali-West/022PXX22-XX22-150314191942-T5N6_BZDET
wait until element b2b_catalogue_company_name is visible
scroll down 1200
wait 2 seconds
scroll down 2400
wait 2 seconds
scroll down 3600
wait 2 seconds
scroll down 4800
wait 2 seconds
scroll down 6000
wait 2 seconds
[ignore 30s] swipe bottom to top until element catalogue_bd_category_popup is visible, max 15 times, wait 1
wait 1 seconds
verify element catalogue_bd_category_popup is visible
verify element catalogue_heading_bd_category_pop is visible
verify element catalogue_get_text_bd_category_pop is visible
verify element catalogue_checked_bd_category_rfq_pop is visible
verify element catalogue_1st_label_bd_category_pop is visible
verify element catalogue_label_last_bd_category_pop is visible
verify element catalogue_get_verified_seller_button_bd_category_pop is visible
verify element catalogue_skip_bd_category_pop is visible
click catalogue_get_verified_seller_button_bd_category_pop
wait 2 seconds
# OFF: click rfq_skip_all_button
js click rfq_skip_all_button
# OFF: call RFQ_Non_Login_Flow_to_Login_and_Continue_Search
